    <article class="pricing-card popular"><span class="pricing-type">START A PROJECT</span><h2>Project intake form</h2><p class="muted" style="font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 20px">Give us the details up front so we can understand what you need before the first conversation.</p><a class="button primary" asp-page="/StartProject">Open the Intake Form</a></article>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><span class="kicker">READY TO BUILD?</span><h2>Websites &amp; custom software<br />built around your business.</h2><p>Tell us what you're trying to accomplish. We'll help you figure out the right way to build it.</p><a class="button primary large" asp-page="/StartProject">Let's Talk</a></div></section>
